<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="10">
<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1002S_S000E" variety="S000E">
<name>Vehicle Surroundings Monitor</name>
<ttl id="1002S_S000E_746W2_T00DG" variety="T00DG">
<name>Back Guide Monitor System</name>
<para id="RM0000002O2049X" category="D" type-id="3001B" name-id="672R5-18" from="200912">
<name>How to Proceed with Troubleshooting</name>
<subpara id="RM0000002O2049X_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___0000HXD00000">
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<descript-diag>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Vehicle brought to workshop</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Customer Problem Analysis and Symptom Check</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Customer Problem Analysis and Symptom Check (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000045U011X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Basic Inspection</testtitle>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Basic Inspection</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the battery voltage.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Standard</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>11 to 14 V (IG OFF)</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Inspect areas that can be checked visually, such as blown fuses, open or short circuits in the wire harness and poor connector connections.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>CAN Communication System Check</testtitle>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check ECUs Connected to CAN Bus (Check Connection Status Using TaSCAN)</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), select "Diagnosis" → "CAN Bus Diagnosis" → "CAN Bus Connected ECU Check" to display the connected ECU check screen. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000001R4W019X"/>)</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check the screen display for approximately 1 minutes, and check the display of all ECUs and sensors connected to CAN communication.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No Abnormality</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Abnormal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to CAN Communication System (see <xref label="Seep03" href="RM0000005RL02ZX"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Back Guide Monitor System - DTC Check</testtitle>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>DTC Check</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Start the engine, select "System Diagnosis/Body" → "System Name/Navigation System" → "DTC" on the SST (TaSCAN) screen, and check the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep04" href="RM000000OCQ05NX"/>)</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>Check the DTCs with the engine running.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Record the DTCs.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear DTC</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Recheck DTC</ptxt>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>The navigation receiver assembly outputs DTCs for the following systems.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If a DTC not listed in Back Guide Monitor System - Diagnostic Trouble Code Chart is output, refer to the other systems.</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>System Name</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Reference</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>HDD Navigation System</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>
<xref label="Seep05" href="RM0000002RS05SX"/>
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>ETC System</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>
<xref label="Seep07" href="RM000001US9017X"/>
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No code</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Symptom is confirmed and can be reproduced)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No code</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Symptom cannot be confirmed or reproduced)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Code output</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Back Guide Monitor System)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Code output</ptxt>
<ptxt>(HDD Navigation System)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>D</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Code output</ptxt>
<ptxt>(ETC System)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>E</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to Symptom Simulation (see <xref label="Seep08" href="RM000000ABY07EX"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result>C</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to step 9</action-ci-right>
<result>D</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to HDD Navigation System - Diagnostic Trouble Code Chart</action-ci-right>
<result>E</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to ETC System - Diagnostic Trouble Code Chart</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Symptom Check</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check whether the same symptom occurs with the HDD navigation system. (see <xref label="Seep09" href="RM0000008WW03VX"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Same symptom does not occur</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Same symptom occurs</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to HDD Navigation System - Problem Symptoms Table (see <xref label="Seep10" href="RM0000008WW03VX"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>List by Symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Problem Symptoms Table (see <xref label="Seep11" href="RM0000002O703RX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Not listed in List by Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Corresponds to List by Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to step 9</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Perform troubleshooting using the following methods based on the problem symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Diagnosis System (see <xref label="Seep12" href="RM0000002O803UX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Terminals of ECU (see <xref label="Seep13" href="RM0000002O603VX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Adjust, Repair or Replace</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Work after Replacement</testtitle>
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When the battery terminal is disconnected, perform steering sensor steering angle neutral point memorization. (see <xref label="Seep14" href="RM000000GCY00LX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Depending on the parts replaced or the work performed during vehicle inspection and maintenance, registration and setting operations for other systems as well as the back guide monitor system may be necessary. (see <xref label="Seep15" href="RM000002FZ603QX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Confirmation Test</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
<action-ci-fin>END</action-ci-fin>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
</descript-diag>
</content5>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>